Seemless WP7.5: Win32 event HANDLEs on macOS are directx-native events.

macOS has no eventfd. Neptune (virglrenderer npt_event.c) hands the D3D12
library event handles created by the D3D11 umbrella's embedder API
(dxmt_event_create), i.e. directx-native dxn_event boxes. Signal, wait,
create, duplicate and close them with our statically linked copy of
directx-native. That is only safe because DXMT and this fork pin the same
directx-native revision (7258be1); scripts/build-deps.sh checks that.
